{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00041",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 6.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "All set here, doctor. Chart's updated, and I'll read the readings out when you're ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.05,
      "end_seconds": 10.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Perfect, thanks. Hello there, so what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.41,
      "end_seconds": 23.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.88,
      "text": "Right, um, doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps. Doctor, it's pain in my lower back. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.29,
      "end_seconds": 29.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "How long have you had it? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.4,
      "end_seconds": 37.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "It's been four weeks now. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.69,
      "end_seconds": 45.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind. I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.72,
      "end_seconds": 69.18,
      "duration_seconds": 22.46,
      "text": "Hmm, it's severe, honestly. Sitting for long and bending definitely sets it off. I'd say once or twice a day. My family kept telling me to get it checked. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I've also had pain going into the buttock, for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.45,
      "end_seconds": 73.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.41,
      "end_seconds": 87.23,
      "duration_seconds": 11.82,
      "text": "I'd say severe. There's a muscle spasm as well. With muscle spasm, severe, I'd say. I've had difficulty bending forward too, uh, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.49,
      "end_seconds": 92.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.59,
      "end_seconds": 105.66,
      "duration_seconds": 13.07,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.2,
      "end_seconds": 113.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Any weight loss, bladder problems or weakness in the legs at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.4,
      "end_seconds": 118.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "No, you know, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.33,
      "end_seconds": 121.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "And fever, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.08,
      "end_seconds": 127.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Not at all, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 129.11,
      "end_seconds": 134.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Hmm, actually, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.37,
      "end_seconds": 143.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "No, you know, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.73,
      "end_seconds": 152.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.41,
      "end_seconds": 155.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.34,
      "end_seconds": 159.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.38,
      "end_seconds": 165.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Shellfish. I come out in... well, hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.89,
      "end_seconds": 170.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.94,
      "end_seconds": 182.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.53,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.24,
      "end_seconds": 190.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.7,
      "end_seconds": 209.35,
      "duration_seconds": 18.65,
      "text": "Um, I've had high blood pressure for about a year now. I took the morning off to come in today. Oh, I've had arthritis in my knees, yes. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.18,
      "end_seconds": 212.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.13,
      "end_seconds": 218.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Uh, I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 219.63,
      "end_seconds": 223.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 25 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.76,
      "end_seconds": 228.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.31,
      "end_seconds": 234.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Paracetamol. I take it when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.65,
      "end_seconds": 237.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.22,
      "end_seconds": 239.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.43,
      "end_seconds": 240.4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.02,
      "end_seconds": 243.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.43,
      "end_seconds": 246.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.44,
      "end_seconds": 252.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "So, I had a hernia repair about five years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 253.68,
      "end_seconds": 261.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse 69, respiratory rate 16. Temperature is 36.8 degrees, blood pressure 125 over 77, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.52,
      "end_seconds": 263.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.79,
      "end_seconds": 267.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.17,
      "end_seconds": 269.11,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.88,
      "end_seconds": 278.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.55,
      "end_seconds": 282.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.25,
      "end_seconds": 286.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.32,
      "end_seconds": 307.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Straight leg raise is negative on both sides and power in the legs is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.53,
      "end_seconds": 311.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.5,
      "end_seconds": 329.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "There's tenderness over the muscles on the right of the lower back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.27,
      "end_seconds": 352.16,
      "duration_seconds": 20.89,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is mechanical low back pain. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. I can't rule out a disc problem yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.95,
      "end_seconds": 362.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your lower back for four weeks, severe, and no weakness in the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.09,
      "end_seconds": 364.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.93,
      "end_seconds": 373.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "Let's get an X-ray of the lower back, for back pain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.02,
      "end_seconds": 375.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.56,
      "end_seconds": 393.01,
      "duration_seconds": 16.45,
      "text": "I'm going to order an MRI of the lumbar spine, for persistent back pain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'd like you to take ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, twice a day after food, for five days. That should help with back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.19,
      "end_seconds": 398.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Alright, uh, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.06,
      "end_seconds": 418.66,
      "duration_seconds": 19.6,
      "text": "Staying gently active heals back pain faster than bed rest, so keep moving. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. I'd like you to see physiotherapy as well, and I'll write the referral. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 419.53,
      "end_seconds": 421.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.37,
      "end_seconds": 431.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if you get numbness in the groin or lose bladder control, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 433.03,
      "end_seconds": 433.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.43,
      "end_seconds": 443.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks. Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 444.04,
      "end_seconds": 453.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "So, I take the ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, twice a day after food and come back in three weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 455.03,
      "end_seconds": 459.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Alright, yes, exactly right. Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 462.03,
      "end_seconds": 466.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 467.62,
      "end_seconds": 468.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}